   "source": "phase3s/phase3t valu_loop/valu_straight 8k-96k bundles with sync-flag traces (sequencer_overlay events)",
   "capacity_bundles": "phase3y: kernels of 64010 bundles fit, 65408 overlay; with the launching module's 341-bundle TLP program both agree with a 65536-bundle instruction memory (third-party claim), so a kernel gets 65536 - 341 = 65195. Unmodeled: at 65.4-66k bundles (3 chunks) the third chunk is not prefetched (full 7.6 us wait); the model is -7% there.",
